Area,Key_Insight,Recommendation
Sales,November 2017 recorded the highest monthly product revenue.,Study successful months and use the findings to improve future sales campaigns.
Delivery,Late deliveries are strongly associated with lower customer ratings.,Improve delivery reliability and monitor delayed shipments.
Customer Satisfaction,Early deliveries received much higher average ratings than late deliveries.,Prioritize delivery speed and accurate delivery estimates.
Customer Retention,"Most customers made only one purchase, indicating low repeat-purchase activity.","Introduce loyalty programs, personalized offers and repeat-purchase incentives."
Product Categories,Some high-revenue categories have below-average customer ratings.,Investigate product quality and customer complaints in low-rated categories.
Seller Performance,Some sellers have significant sales volume but comparatively low ratings.,Monitor low-rated sellers and improve seller quality standards.
Payment Methods,Credit card is the dominant payment method.,Continue optimizing the credit-card payment experience.
Geographic Sales,São Paulo is the largest customer market by revenue.,Prioritize marketing and logistics resources in high-revenue states.
Logistics,Shipping type analysis can help identify opportunities to optimize freight costs.,Optimize regional seller and inventory allocation to control freight costs.
